common_passwords.txt
--------------------
Source: SecLists, Passwords/Common-Credentials/Pwdb_top-1000000.txt
        https://github.com/danielmiessler/SecLists
License: MIT
Derived file: the first 200,000 entries (the list is ordered by frequency),
casefolded, deduplicated, and cut to the 10-128 characters a password may be
here — a shorter entry is already refused by PASSWORD_FIELD, so it only costs
memory. One password per line.
